<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 6,680 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 119.74 pence a kilo against 119.96 last week and 123.17 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 296,612 pkgs sold so far this year is 113.47 pence against 103.57 pence for the 419,831 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
